\"2,216\"><mn>2,216</mn>\n</math>.</p>","origin":"manifold","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A right rectangular prism has a length of <math alttext=\"28 centimeters left parenthesis cm right parenthesis\"><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>centimeters</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mtext>cm</mtext></mfenced></math>, a width of <math alttext=\"15 cm\"><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></math>, and a height of <math alttext=\"16 cm\"><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>cm</mtext></math>. What is the surface area, <math alttext=\"in cm squared\"><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>cm</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math>, of the right rectangular prism?</p>","externalid":"395e8a55-7af9-456e-a433-3d4a89ade971","templateid":"ec70c438-e786-4bc0-ac23-f3dbc6bed3d0","vaultid":"9bc095b7-8ea2-4e29-951c-ded421da5c20","type":"spr","answerOptions":[],"correct_answer":["2216"]},"createDate":1691007959836,"updateDate":1691007959836}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959836, 1691007959836),
