<p style="text-align: left;">The figure shown is a right circular cylinder with a radius of <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math> and height of <math alttext="h"><mi>h</mi>
</math>. A second right circular cylinder (not shown) has a volume that is <math alttext="392"><mn>392</mn>
