h alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math> units, not <math alttext=\"24\"><mn>24</mn>\n</math> units.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","externalid":"2124991b-31a9-4ce3-a963-094142d78f70","correct_answer":["B"]},"createDate":1743430554980,"updateDate":1743430554980}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1743430554980, 1743430554980),
